VALUES (31414, 'tt0111341', NULL, 'Satantango', 'Sátántangó', 'movie', 1994, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y38z0v4HJ12MHiKddLEoFlvPiBt.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5a4Gmk2HNeefI4Rmwdmbyoy79oy.jpg', 'Inhabitants of a small village in Hungary deal with the effects of the fall of Communism. The town''s source of revenue, a factory, has closed, and the locals, who include a doctor and three couples, await a cash payment offered in the wake of the shuttering. Irimias, a villager thought to be dead, returns and, unbeknownst to the locals, is a police informant. In a scheme, he persuades the villagers to form a commune with him.', NULL, NULL, 3.3678, 8.034, 0, 1.76563636363636362e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-11 05:59:18')
